      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hello, we have some more information on this issue. It seems that it only happens if you have \"Requires 2FA\" on the group role, even if the person has 2FA on their account. Until this is fixed, you may want to try disabling that toggle. Let us know if this helps!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
