      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60285ca04963ba22994f485b|full_name}: Yeah, it looks like that appears to be the cause of the issue. Will need to test more later but hopefully it can be resolved ASAP.\n\nUPDATE: Did some more testing and yeah, it looks like `Requires 2FA` does indeed breaks all role perms unless it's disabled. Disabled it for all the roles that had it and things seem fine now. Hopefully it'll get resolved ASAP considering it's a security feature.",
